    (option-some-of [:option :string] "cloud-itonami-assoc-9411-jpn-keidanren Wave 0 (ADR-2607141700): 26 Keidanren entries -- 24 from Keidanren's own Japanese publication, 1 with precision Wikipedia supplies and Keidanren does not, 1 superseded by another page of Keidanren's own site. Extend `association.facts/catalog`, never fabricate an id/url.")
